Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.15,0:00:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This is now a antibacterial\Nsatellite or a chemical in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.83,0:00:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,ten, ten, ten, ten, ten,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.17,0:00:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.29,0:01:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.55,0:02:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.47,0:03:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.77,0:03:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Satsang with Mooji
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.29,0:04:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.19,0:04:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.95,0:04:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.99,0:04:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, for Pete's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.61,0:04:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What a mess that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.35,0:04:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrounded by that lot, I wondered\Nwhat was going to happen to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.87,0:04:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Back there, it sounded like many\Nof them were saying Bakshish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.79,0:04:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you suppose that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.11,0:04:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It means, give me money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.73,0:04:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What a backward little\Nhellhole this place is. My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.03,0:04:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Polnareff,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.95,0:04:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,once you get used to it, you'll understand\Nthe good things about this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd never get used to a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.65,0:05:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But this chai, or whatever you called\Nit, this is actually fairly decent stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.03,0:05:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's a pretty interesting country.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.39,0:05:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I really kind of like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.47,0:05:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, do you really mean that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.61,0:05:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you say that with a straight face?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.91,0:05:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They say once you live in\Na place, it grows on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.49,0:05:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.93,0:05:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You Asian guys must lack any sense of beauty\Nor elegance to like a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.93,0:05:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.03,0:05:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go take a shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.03,0:05:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What a vulgar man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.63,0:05:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.91,0:05:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Our dishes have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.43,0:05:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.34,0:05:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And they look delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.87,0:05:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.78,0:05:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I would expect\Nfrom a tourist cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.87,0:05:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A clean bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.69,0:05:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.27,0:06:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,India getting close.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.91,0:06:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.71,0:06:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.05,0:06:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You are...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.93,0:06:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.84,0:06:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No one there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.75,0:06:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I imagine it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.69,0:06:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I saw some strange guy\Noutside the window just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.05,0:06:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.96,0:06:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.67,0:06:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.58,0:06:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.53,0:06:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can I only see him in the mirror?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.15,0:07:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.55,0:07:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A right hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.67,0:07:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.55,0:07:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no you don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.21,0:07:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver Chariot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddamn shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.79,0:07:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.23,0:07:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he disappear to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.59,0:07:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, where is the main body of that stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.81,0:07:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,God damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.07,0:07:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never find him in a\Ncrowded place like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.21,0:07:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened, Polnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, I found him. It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.53,0:08:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The bastard who killed my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.01,0:08:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.81,0:08:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, just hold on, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.35,0:08:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel, but calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.05,0:08:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be an enemy trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.61,0:08:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.53,0:08:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You say you understand my feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.21,0:08:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I must say you impress me, Avdol. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.83,0:08:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,My younger sister and I, we lost\Nour parents at an early age.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.93,0:08:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We tried our best to get by\Nall on our own after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.27,0:08:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then my sister was brutally\Nviolated and murdered!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.03,0:08:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,These feelings of mine...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.21,0:08:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd have to live through\Nthat to ever understand them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.39,0:08:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.19,0:09:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Joestar,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.57,0:09:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but it's time I part ways with\Nall of you and continue my journey alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.45,0:09:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that, Polnareff? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.15,0:09:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I know my sister's\Nassailant is somewhere close by,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.89,0:09:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't rest easy until I find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.27,0:09:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you don't know his face\Nor the true nature of his stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.79,0:09:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I know both of his hands are right\Nhands, and that's good enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.63,0:09:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They say the tomb robber\Nbecomes the mummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.11,0:09:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.33,0:09:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.03,0:09:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You think that this guy\Nis going to defeat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.21,0:09:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saying it's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.81,0:09:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be all alone\Nagainst an unknown stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.37,0:09:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Avdol,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.87,0:10:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that when you met\NDio for the first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.55,0:10:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,you were so frightened that you ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.09,0:10:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.65,0:10:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been alone from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.31,0:10:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I have fought all of my\Nbattles alone, until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.33,0:10:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.31,0:10:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make this perfectly clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.49,0:10:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,First of all, I don't care\Nabout that guy Dio one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.35,0:10:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe I told you that I was only coming\Nalong with you to seek my own vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.13,0:10:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Paul Naref, don't try to stop him, Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.01,0:10:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but Mr. Joestar...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.49,0:10:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right. Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.63,0:10:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.09,0:10:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Joestar, you're very understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.25,0:10:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, see ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.29,0:11:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, looks like we'd gone and provoked\Nthat boy, didn't we, Mr. J. Kyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.97,0:11:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.97,0:11:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to you\Nyesterday? I waited such a long
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.37,0:11:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,time hold your horses did\NI promise I'd be there
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.17,0:11:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,no oh no please I want\Nto stay with you for the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.95,0:11:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,rest of my life stop talking\Ncrazy like hell you just
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.67,0:11:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,barely turned 16 girl I'm\Nold enough to marry and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.81,0:11:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you with all my\Nheart hey I'm just a drifter
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.61,0:11:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I got no home I live this\Nwhole life day to day
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.29,0:11:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and in the end I'm destined\Nto die on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.39,0:11:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.27,0:12:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You come from one of them\Naristocratic families.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.09,0:12:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be thinking about\Nmarrying old cowboy like me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.21,0:12:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,even though we love each other\Nso very, very much, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.59,0:12:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.97,0:12:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you say that you love me more\Nthan anyone else in the whole world?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.01,0:12:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.11,0:12:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,More than anyone else\Nin a whole wide world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.65,0:12:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.07,0:12:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because I love you so\Nmuch, I can't marry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.03,0:12:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.99,0:12:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, darn, this is so\Nheartbreakingly difficult for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.61,0:12:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.85,0:12:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold you like this from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.89,0:12:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.45,0:12:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.45,0:12:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you best run on home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.23,0:12:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Your parents be worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.83,0:12:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'd better be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that was damn annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.73,0:13:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're probably thinking I'm\Njust complicating things again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.53,0:13:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's mighty damn convenient to have\Nthat kind of woman all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.27,0:13:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll do anything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.05,0:13:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Even sacrifice their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.67,0:13:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You already know the way I like to\Ndo things, don't you, Mr. J. Guile?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.57,0:13:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, just as we expected,\NPolnarev's gone off by his self.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.99,0:13:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Reckon we ought to go\Nkill him now or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.41,0:13:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.15,0:14:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.25,0:14:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.95,0:14:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody asks you if you've seen a\Nman whose hands are both right hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.83,0:14:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Send him over towards\Nthe outskirts of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.55,0:14:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, of course, Kainzor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.03,0:14:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Step one completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.63,0:14:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen a man whose\Nhands are both right hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.35,0:14:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.77,0:14:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.03,0:15:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is ready, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.79,0:15:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we just wait for the\Nprey to step into our trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.53,0:15:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.35,0:16:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.27,0:16:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we hit the trail?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.01,0:16:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, with your stand, the hanged\Nman and mind the emperor being partners,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.25,0:16:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,we can kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.43,0:16:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to find some transportation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.17,0:16:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We can leave whenever you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.67,0:17:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.58,0:17:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we get underway?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.45,0:17:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Avdol-san, what's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.01,0:17:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.55,0:17:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Joestar,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.05,0:17:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't it seem strange\Nthat our enemy waited
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.57,0:17:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,until Polnareff was alone\Nbefore showing himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.61,0:17:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.89,0:17:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My instincts keep telling me that this\Nwas just a ploy to lure him away from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.75,0:17:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, I feel exactly\Nthe same way myself, Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.03,0:17:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And we can't just leave things like this\Nwhen our comrade might be in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.27,0:17:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, let's get in the truck now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.05,0:17:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.21,0:18:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.21,0:18:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You say you've seen him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.19,0:18:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.43,0:18:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sure you saw him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.13,0:18:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A man whose hands are\Nboth right hands. Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.73,0:18:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.77,0:18:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,On the street, over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.65,0:18:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So he is here, at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.37,0:18:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.65,0:18:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This traffic is backed up solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.11,0:18:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not going to make any\Nprogress at all at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.13,0:18:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He couldn't have gotten too far, so\Nlet's split up and search for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.97,0:19:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take this direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.49,0:19:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin, stay with the truck. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.61,0:19:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.31,0:19:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The gun is mightier than the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.89,0:19:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's a fine saying, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.79,0:19:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.27,0:19:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, just who the hell are you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.87,0:20:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Name's Holley Horse, and I control\Nthe Stand that's known as the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.25,0:20:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn\Nabout you or your stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.07,0:20:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a man whose\Nhands are both right hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.13,0:20:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, what a rude fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.01,0:20:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You asked, so I introduced myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.37,0:20:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.65,0:20:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're looking for my partner,\Nhe's around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.41,0:20:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.15,0:20:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.06,0:20:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.43,0:20:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I don't have a lot of time to\Nwaste on a little shit like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.39,0:20:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.07,0:20:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehe!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.47,0:20:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.38,0:20:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.57,0:20:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Know what Lord Dio told me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.71,0:20:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy Polnareff has a habit\Nof underestimating his enemies,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.87,0:20:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,so it's easy to whoop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.71,0:20:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is true, so I just had to laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.85,0:20:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.59,0:21:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're saying I have to beat you to get\Nto him, well then you give me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.07,0:21:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,...but to grant your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.07,0:21:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It cannot be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.75,0:21:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not do anything rash, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.07,0:21:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to rush things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.93,0:21:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Polnareff, you ever heard of\Nthat game called Soldier's Chess?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.31,0:21:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldier's Chess?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.63,0:21:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The tank is stronger than the\Nsoldier, but weaker than the mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.45,0:21:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's a game based on the\Nfundamental principles of battle and such.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.55,0:21:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,In the case of Whole Horses\NEmperor and you, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.17,0:21:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,the rules of Soldier's Tests\Napply perfectly, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.11,0:21:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, the gun's mightier\Nthan the sword, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.15,0:21:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, just what the hell are\Nyou trying to get at anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.89,0:22:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, my stand is the gun,\Nso your sword can't beat my gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.47,0:22:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.61,0:22:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I can beat your bum?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.45,0:22:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're into that stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.31,0:22:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.23,0:22:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fucking kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.73,0:22:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You underestimated me,\NPolnareff. You lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.95,0:23:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I can't strike\Ndown a bullet like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.69,0:23:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Piece of cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.51,0:23:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver, cheerio!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.63,0:23:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.67,0:23:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.03,0:23:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It changed directions!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.31,0:23:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the bullet is part of my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.31,0:23:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.61,0:23:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't expect that, did ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.37,0:23:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.01,0:23:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.43,0:23:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Avdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.34,0:23:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I was worried, so I came looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.15,0:23:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You worried about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.91,0:23:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy knows everything\Nthere is to know about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.87,0:23:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you had battled alone until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.49,0:23:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But from now on, you cannot win alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.53,0:23:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.65,0:24:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still lecturing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.85,0:24:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.35,0:24:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You picked a hell of a time to\Ninterfere with our showdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.35,0:24:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.11,0:24:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the way, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.81,0:24:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The bullet, it is returning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.95,0:24:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He is able to control\Nthe path of this bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.39,0:24:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You can avoid a sword,\Nbut what about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.37,0:24:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll burn it away. Magicians!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.13,0:24:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Abdo-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.25,0:24:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, the bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.95,0:24:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Andrew-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.17,0:25:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.91,0:25:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.99,0:25:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.51,0:25:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, now this is fortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.07,0:25:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, my gun and J.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.83,0:25:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Giles' mirror, they just don't\Nget along with Abdel's fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.61,0:25:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, they're very lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.37,0:26:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,For us, there are no more pieces to\Nworry about in this soldier's chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.79,0:26:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Avdol, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.07,0:26:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.87,0:26:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.43,0:26:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.13,0:26:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.81,0:26:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You like to lecture others so\Nmuch and just look what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.75,0:26:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say, Polnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.83,0:26:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he tried to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.05,0:26:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Avdol-san is...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.97,0:26:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Who asked him to save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.31,0:26:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What a nosy meddler, always lecturing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.75,0:26:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A guy like him gets to be a drag.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.77,0:26:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I told you that\NI wanted to do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.33,0:27:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, I can't believe I'm\Nhearing this from you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.51,0:27:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so damned annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.59,0:27:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,For someone to die right before my eyes\Nlike that, that is so goddamned annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.23,0:28:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.45,0:29:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.81,0:29:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.87,0:30:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
